      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T16:51:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this name is confusing because it doesn\u0027t express whether old filtering needs to be removed, it expresses whether filtering was in place. Similarly, even if needToAddNewFiltering is true it doesn\u0027t mean that new filtering needs to be added, because the filtering could be already there. Also I think the names are too long and will cause line wrapping.\n\nHow about:\n\n    final boolean wasFiltering \u003d requiresVpnFiltering(..., oldLp);\n    final boolean shouldFilter \u003d requiresVpnFiltering(..., newLp);\n\nOr maybe requiresVpnIsolation? ...?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5452,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 5455,
        "endChar": 71
      },
      "revId": "70bebaa42a6187b169033ecee1984b3997f2c25c",
