      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T16:51:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When you move this to a function, unindent.\n\n    if (!wasFiltering \u0026\u0026 !needsFiltering) {\n        return;\n    }\n\nBut also, consider whether you need this code at all. If both of these are false, then the code won\u0027t really do much anyway except calculate a few booleans (and make a copy of the UID ranges in the networkcapabilities).",
