      "writtenOn": "2019-03-29T16:51:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here too:\n\n    if (Objects.equals(oldIface, newIface) \u0026\u0026 (wasFiltering \u003d\u003d shouldFilter)) {\n        // Nothing to do.\n        return;\n    }\n\nAlso, for readability, consider calculating all the booleans beforehand and then putting the logic later.\n\n    final String oldIf \u003d oldLp !\u003d null ? oldLp.getInterfaceName() : null;\n    final String newIf \u003d newLp !\u003d null ? newLp.getInterfaceName() : null;\n    final boolean wasFiltering \u003d requiresVpnFiltering(..., oldLp);\n    final boolean shouldFilter \u003d requiresVpnFiltering(..., newLp);\n\n    if (!wasFiltering \u0026\u0026 !needsFiltering) {\n        // Nothing to do.\n        return;\n    }\n\n    if (Objects.equals(oldLp, newLp) \u0026\u0026 (wasFiltering \u003d\u003d needsFiltering)) {\n        // Nothing changed.\n        return;\n    }\n\n    final Set\u003cUidRange\u003e ranges \u003d networkAgent.networkCapabilities.getUids();\n    final int vpnAppUid \u003d networkAgent.networkCapabilities.getEstablishingVpnAppUid();\n\n    if (wasFiltering) {\n        mPermissionMonitor.onVpnUidRangesRemoved(oldIf, ranges, vpnAppUid);\n    }\n\n    if (shouldFilter) {\n        mPermissionMonitor.onVpnUidRangesAdded(newIf, ranges, vpnAppUid);\n    }",
